			text = [=[Aegwynn outlived the son she made. When the {link:dark-portal}Dark Portal{/link} opened and the {link:horde}Horde{/link} came, the world learned what her pride had cost. {link:medivh}Medivh{/link} fell in {link:karazhan}Karazhan{/link}, and the line of the Guardians ended with him. Aegwynn herself went into exile, her power spent. It is whispered among the learned of {link:theramore-isle}Theramore{/link} that an old woman of great wisdom has lived for a time in the wilds of {link:kalimdor}Kalimdor{/link} and has counselled Lady {link:jaina-proudmoore}Jaina Proudmoore{/link}. Few know her name, and those who do keep it to themselves.]=],
