			text = [=[Malfurion Stormrage was the first {link:night-elves}night elf{/link} druid, the student of the demigod {link:cenarius}Cenarius{/link} and the twin brother of {link:illidan-stormrage}Illidan Stormrage{/link}. He led the fight against the {link:burning-legion}Burning Legion{/link} in the {link:war-of-the-ancients}War of the Ancients{/link} and again in the {link:third-war}Third War{/link}. He is the beloved of {link:tyrande-whisperwind}Tyrande Whisperwind{/link}. He now sleeps in the {link:emerald-dream}Emerald Dream{/link}, and his people wait for him to wake.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[Malfurion saved the world twice. In ancient times he destroyed the {link:well-of-eternity}Well of Eternity{/link} to close the door to the Legion. Ten thousand years later he destroyed {link:archimonde}Archimonde{/link} at the foot of the World Tree. The druids of every land follow the path he first walked.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "The War of the Ancients",
			text = [=[Malfurion was drawn to the living world while his brother studied the arcane. {link:cenarius}Cenarius{/link} took him as a student and taught him to shape the powers of nature. When {link:queen-azshara}Queen Azshara{/link} and her Highborne brought the Legion into the world, Malfurion joined the resistance. He saw that the Legion could only be stopped by destroying the {link:well-of-eternity}Well of Eternity{/link} itself. His attack upon it set in motion the {link:great-sundering}Great Sundering{/link}, which shattered the land and drowned the queen's capital. When {link:illidan-stormrage}Illidan{/link} made a new Well on {link:mount-hyjal}Mount Hyjal{/link}, Malfurion had him imprisoned. With the aid of the great dragons, the survivors planted {link:nordrassil}Nordrassil{/link} atop the new Well. Malfurion and his druids then went into a long sleep in the {link:emerald-dream}Emerald Dream{/link}.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "The Third War",
			text = [=[When the Legion returned, {link:tyrande-whisperwind}Tyrande{/link} woke the druids. Malfurion led them back into the world and helped hold the forests of {link:ashenvale}Ashenvale{/link} against the demons. Against his will, Tyrande freed {link:illidan-stormrage}Illidan{/link}, and he was too late to stop his brother from taking the power of a demon. He banished Illidan and returned to the defense of Hyjal. There he stood with the orcs of {link:thrall}Thrall{/link} and the men of {link:jaina-proudmoore}Jaina Proudmoore{/link}. When {link:archimonde}Archimonde{/link} reached {link:nordrassil}Nordrassil{/link}, Malfurion sounded the Horn of {link:cenarius}Cenarius{/link}. The spirits of the ancients destroyed the demon lord, and the world was saved.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Deeds",
			text = [=[• He learned the ways of nature from {link:cenarius}Cenarius{/link} and became the first druid.
• He destroyed the {link:well-of-eternity}Well of Eternity{/link} and ended the {link:war-of-the-ancients}War of the Ancients{/link}.
• He imprisoned his brother beneath the earth.
• He led the druids against the Legion in the {link:third-war}Third War{/link}.
• He destroyed {link:archimonde}Archimonde{/link} at the {link:battle-of-mount-hyjal}Battle of Mount Hyjal{/link}.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Fate",
			text = [=[After the war, Malfurion hunted {link:illidan-stormrage}Illidan{/link} across the sea, then let him go. He returned to the {link:emerald-dream}Emerald Dream{/link} and has not woken since. In his absence, Arch Druid {link:fandral-staghelm}Fandral Staghelm{/link} leads the druids of {link:darnassus}Darnassus{/link}, and the night elves have planted a new World Tree, {link:teldrassil}Teldrassil{/link}. {link:tyrande-whisperwind}Tyrande{/link} rules and waits.]=],
