• He whispered to {link:azshara}Azshara{/link} and nearly entered the world.
• He hid within {link:aegwynn}Aegwynn{/link} and {link:medivh}Medivh{/link}, and opened the {link:dark-portal}Dark Portal{/link} through him.]=],
